{"name":"Bell in the Depths","status":"ok","title":"Bell in the Depths","pageId":13290,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-frwiki pi-layout-default type-location\" role=\"region\">\n\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Bell in the Depths</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Geography<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TMSp63_3-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TMSp63-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-MotMp77_4-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MotMp77-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aliases\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Bell of the Depths<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-soz_1-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-soz-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><br/>Bell in the Deep<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-FRCS3_2-0\"><a href=\"#cite_note-FRCS3-2\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>2<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"type\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Type</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ruins</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"region\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Moonsea_(lake)\" title=\"Moonsea (lake)\">Moonsea</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/North_Faer%C3%BBn\" title=\"North Faerûn\">north Faerûn</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n</aside>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>The <b>Bell in the Depths</b> was one of the great mysterious sites in the <a href=\"/wiki/Moonsea_(lake)\" title=\"Moonsea (lake)\">Moonsea</a>. It was connected with legendary <a href=\"/wiki/Northkeep\" title=\"Northkeep\">Northkeep</a>, an island kingdom that was the first <a href=\"/wiki/Human\" title=\"Human\">human</a> citadel in the <a href=\"/wiki/Moonsea\" title=\"Moonsea\">Moonsea</a> region.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TMSp63_3-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TMSp63-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-MotMp77_4-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MotMp77-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<div class=\"frquote\">\n<div class=\"quotesymbol\" style=\"line-height: 32px;\">“</div>\n<div class=\"quotetext\"><i>You know, if there's one place I wouldn't recommend visiting, it's the Bell of the Depths. Unless you're armed to the teeth for <a href=\"/wiki/Sahuagin\" title=\"Sahuagin\">sahuagin</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Undead\" title=\"Undead\">undead</a>, it's best to avoid the place altogether...</i></div>\n<div class=\"quotesymbol\" style=\"align-self: flex-end; line-height: 12px;\">”</div>\n</div><div class=\"quotesource\">— <a href=\"/wiki/Skullcrusher_(Phlan)\" title=\"Skullcrusher (Phlan)\">Skullcrusher of Phlan</a><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-soz_1-1\"><a href=\"#cite_note-soz-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup></div>\n<div aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\" class=\"toc\" id=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\"><input class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" role=\"button\" style=\"display:none\" type=\"checkbox\"/><div class=\"toctitle\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#History\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">History</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Description\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Description</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Appendix\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appendix</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Appearances\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Appearances</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Games\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Games</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#References\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3.2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">References</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"History\">History</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: History\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bell_in_the_Depths?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: History\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Northkeep was a great and magical city, and it was while under the protection of those magics that humanity began to press back the <a href=\"/wiki/Orc\" title=\"Orc\">orc</a> hordes and take command of the sea.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TMSp63_3-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TMSp63-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-MotMp77_4-2\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MotMp77-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>The power of Northkeep made it an obvious target for orcs, giants, and other evil races. One day in the <a href=\"/wiki/400_DR\" title=\"400 DR\">Year of the Blue Shield, 400 DR</a>, 40,000 inhuman <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Mage\" title=\"Mage\">mages</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Shaman\" title=\"Shaman\">shamans</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Witch_doctor\" title=\"Witch doctor\">witch doctors</a>, and <a class=\"mw-redirect\" href=\"/wiki/Priest\" title=\"Priest\">priests</a> of all foul races gathered on the northern shore of the Moonsea, and began to chant, bringing the vengeance of their gods down upon the human interlopers. Their gods (at least some of them) came and destroyed their priests for disturbing them, but they also sank Northkeep beneath the waves.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TMSp63_3-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TMSp63-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-MotMp77_4-3\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MotMp77-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Description\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bell_in_the_Depths?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Description\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The upper reaches of Northkeep—its slender, now-broken spires—could be seen beneath the water by boats that sailed near by. This was not attempted often, as the region was said to be haunted by the original defenders of Northkeep, seeking company in their watch over the <a href=\"/wiki/Cold_Lands\" title=\"Cold Lands\">Cold Lands</a>. On foggy nights, the bells could be heard as far away as <a href=\"/wiki/Hillsfar\" title=\"Hillsfar\">Hillsfar</a>.<sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-TMSp63_3-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-TMSp63-3\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>3<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup><sup class=\"reference\" id=\"cite_ref-MotMp77_4-4\"><a href=\"#cite_note-MotMp77-4\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">[</span>4<span class=\"cite-bracket\">]</span></a></sup>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appendix\">Appendix</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appendix\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bell_in_the_Depths?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Appendix\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"metadata plainlinks stub\"><tbody><tr>\n<td><i>This article is incomplete.</i> <i>You can help the Forgotten Realms Wiki by providing more information.</i></td>\n</tr></tbody></table>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearances\">Appearances</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a aria-label=\"Edit section: Appearances\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-action=\"edit-section\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Bell_in_the_Depths?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Appearances\"></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div class=\"block-indent\"><h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Games\">Video Games</span></h4><div class=\"block-indent\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Neverwinter_Nights_2:_Storm_of_Zehir\" title=\"Neverwinter Nights 2: Storm of Zehir\">Neverwinter Nights 2: Storm of Zehir</a></i></div></div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"References\